{'symbol': 'POOL', 'date': '2021-12-16 07:00:00', 'title': 'POOL CORPORATION FINALIZES ITS ACQUISITION OF PORPOISE POOL & PATIO', 'text': "COVINGTON, LA., DEC. 16, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- POOL CORPORATION (NASDAQ/GSM:POOL) HAS COMPLETED ITS PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED ACQUISITION OF LARGO, FLORIDA-BASED PORPOISE POOL & PATIO, INC. (“PORPOISE”). PORPOISE'S PRIMARY OPERATIONS CONSIST OF SUN WHOLESALE SUPPLY, INC., A WHOLESALE DISTRIBUTOR OF SWIMMING POOL AND OUTDOOR-LIVING PRODUCTS, INCLUDING A SPECIALTY CHEMICAL PACKAGING OPERATION. IT ALSO SERVICES PINCH A PENNY, INC., A FRANCHISOR OF POOL AND OUTDOOR LIVING-RELATED SPECIALTY RETAIL STORES WITH APPROXIMATELY 260 INDEPENDENTLY OWNED AND OPERATED FRANCHISED STORES IN FLORIDA, TEXAS, LOUISIANA, ALABAMA AND GEORGIA."}